WEBVTT

00:00:24.140 --> 00:00:27.070
Go! Shock!! Gourmet!! Gourmet!!

00:00:30.940 --> 00:00:33.840
Go! Shock!!

00:00:35.210 --> 00:00:38.180
Friends who can eat the same dream

00:00:38.280 --> 00:00:41.020
Friends who share the same future

00:00:41.220 --> 00:00:43.720
With you guys

00:00:43.750 --> 00:00:46.720
It’s first-rate gourmet my way!

00:00:46.720 --> 00:00:49.390
If we join forces

00:00:49.460 --> 00:00:52.360
We’ll be invincible

00:00:52.360 --> 00:00:55.700
Come on, let’s show ‘em

00:00:57.930 --> 00:01:02.870
Delicious food gives life

00:01:03.710 --> 00:01:09.010
So be thankful for everything and

00:01:09.010 --> 00:01:11.080
Let’s eat!!

00:01:11.080 --> 00:01:14.020
We can’t lose!! We can’t be stopped!!

00:01:14.020 --> 00:01:17.150
We ain’t gonna let ‘em have that

00:01:17.920 --> 00:01:22.320
We’re gonna win it!! Shock! 
Shock! Gourmet king!!

00:01:22.320 --> 00:01:25.330
Spiked Punch!! Infinity!!

00:01:25.330 --> 00:01:29.030
I’ll punch through with this fist

00:01:29.130 --> 00:01:33.070
First-rate gourmet my way!

00:01:33.070 --> 00:01:35.940
Let’s gather ‘round the table

00:01:35.940 --> 00:01:39.940
For the sake of tomorrow

00:01:39.940 --> 00:01:42.140
Let’s go! Go! Gourmet!!

00:01:47.480 --> 00:01:49.920
Someone once said...

00:01:50.450 --> 00:01:56.260
This kangaroo has a pouch full 
of slowly simmering curry roux

00:01:56.260 --> 00:02:00.900
that it protects from outside enemies...

00:02:01.230 --> 00:02:05.330
Kangaroux!

00:02:07.000 --> 00:02:11.270
A sweet and sour scent wafts from 
this giraffe, whose body is covered

00:02:11.670 --> 00:02:18.250
in juicy, ripe oranges and has a 
refreshing orange flavor to boot...

00:02:19.310 --> 00:02:23.820
Orangiraffe!

00:02:24.820 --> 00:02:28.050
The world is in the Gourmet Age...

00:02:28.050 --> 00:02:33.160
An age in which people quest for 
yet unknown culinary delights!

00:02:36.000 --> 00:02:39.770
At last, Toriko tackles the 
final task given by Master Chin

00:02:39.770 --> 00:02:44.600
so he can capture the treasure 
of Chowlin Temple, Bubble Fruit!

00:02:45.240 --> 00:02:49.010
But meanwhile, the temple is in danger!

00:02:53.280 --> 00:02:55.550
C-Chiyo-san?!

00:02:57.180 --> 00:03:03.160
Tragedy! The End of Chowlin 
Temple! Farewell, Komatsu!

00:03:38.190 --> 00:03:39.420
W-What the...?!

00:03:54.810 --> 00:03:56.710
That's...

00:03:57.440 --> 00:04:00.410
I've just come to say goodbye.

00:04:00.410 --> 00:04:01.350
Goodbye?

00:04:01.350 --> 00:04:05.450
Goodbye to all of you, who are 
about to move to the "other side".

00:04:08.550 --> 00:04:11.490
Again with that stupid pose of gratitude?

00:05:02.400 --> 00:05:04.240
This isn't good...

00:05:04.240 --> 00:05:06.940
Don't tell me I'm sensing...

00:05:06.940 --> 00:05:08.480
I have to hurry.

00:05:35.700 --> 00:05:37.700
Is he at his limit?

00:05:42.540 --> 00:05:45.950
Oh, no... I'm about to pass out...

00:06:18.910 --> 00:06:20.780
Autophagy, I believe.

00:06:20.780 --> 00:06:24.620
I ate my own cells!

00:06:24.620 --> 00:06:26.790
Now I can keep going!

00:06:26.790 --> 00:06:29.760
Alright, that's the spirit!

00:07:02.450 --> 00:07:04.360
I don't believe it!

00:07:04.360 --> 00:07:05.820
It's too long!

00:07:06.220 --> 00:07:08.030
Way too long!

00:07:09.390 --> 00:07:12.300
Is there really an end point?

00:07:12.300 --> 00:07:15.730
Does the Bubble Fruit really exist?

00:07:16.370 --> 00:07:19.700
Endless thoughts of gratitude are 
necessary. Nothing but appreciation.

00:07:19.700 --> 00:07:22.840
If you do that, the temple 
treasure will appear.

00:07:23.770 --> 00:07:25.310
Appear?

00:07:30.910 --> 00:07:34.150
What does "appear" mean?

00:07:53.070 --> 00:07:56.770
In the first place, autophagy 
is just an emergency measure.

00:07:56.770 --> 00:07:59.140
Its effect doesn't last that long.

00:08:03.950 --> 00:08:06.680
Is this as far as I go?

00:08:21.960 --> 00:08:23.900
Don't be afraid! Let's go!

00:08:25.330 --> 00:08:27.840
Chowlin Temple Moon Mochi Formation!

00:08:55.960 --> 00:08:56.960
Huh?

00:08:56.960 --> 00:08:58.470
Yes! We're not dead!

00:09:13.150 --> 00:09:15.880
Chiyo-sama! Why?!

00:09:15.880 --> 00:09:19.120
Anyway, until Master Chin returns,

00:09:19.120 --> 00:09:21.320
it's up to us to handle this situation!

00:09:49.410 --> 00:09:51.680
I'm sorry, Komatsu...

00:09:52.150 --> 00:09:53.320
Coco...

00:09:53.850 --> 00:09:55.150
Sunny...

00:09:55.850 --> 00:09:57.160
Zebra...

00:09:57.920 --> 00:09:58.890
Rin...

00:09:59.890 --> 00:10:01.690
Old Man Ichiryu...

00:10:03.130 --> 00:10:04.230
I think...

00:10:05.500 --> 00:10:06.830
...I'm...

00:10:10.430 --> 00:10:11.870
...gonna die.

00:10:27.750 --> 00:10:29.950
Please leave this to me!

00:10:45.800 --> 00:10:47.440
Get away, quickly!

00:10:57.710 --> 00:11:01.120
The Golem is enjoying itself!

00:11:20.440 --> 00:11:21.840
Never would've thought...

00:11:22.670 --> 00:11:25.010
...my end would come by starvation.

00:11:32.010 --> 00:11:36.080
I can hear the faint beating of my heart.

00:11:37.690 --> 00:11:44.530
I've been pushin' this body 
too hard for too long.

00:11:46.960 --> 00:11:50.730
Thank you so much for everything.

00:11:51.700 --> 00:11:55.540
And to the source of all that...

00:11:55.970 --> 00:11:59.110
You became my flesh and blood...

00:11:59.470 --> 00:12:01.340
To all the ingredients I ever ate...

00:12:04.510 --> 00:12:06.110
All the food...

00:12:13.090 --> 00:12:15.020
I'm so grateful...

00:13:23.590 --> 00:13:26.520
My worn-out life

00:13:26.520 --> 00:13:29.090
is being lifted up gently.

00:13:30.760 --> 00:13:33.900
This kind warmth

00:13:33.900 --> 00:13:35.900
is the warmth of life.

00:13:37.070 --> 00:13:39.600
I've tasted it many times.

00:13:40.400 --> 00:13:42.370
The warmth of ingredients...

00:13:48.310 --> 00:13:50.710
It seems he made it in time.

00:13:51.880 --> 00:13:55.520
This is the genuine Bubble Fruit.

00:13:56.550 --> 00:14:00.020
The treasure was here all this time.

00:14:00.020 --> 00:14:02.930
They were waiting patiently 
for your feelings of gratitude

00:14:02.930 --> 00:14:07.330
towards food to reach the ultimate limit.

00:14:08.900 --> 00:14:11.670
The appearance of Bubble Fruit

00:14:11.670 --> 00:14:15.640
is proof that you truly understand 
the blessing of food.

00:14:16.640 --> 00:14:18.810
Now, go ahead and eat.

00:14:19.840 --> 00:14:20.740
Immerse yourself...

00:14:21.110 --> 00:14:22.780
...in the food!

00:14:37.430 --> 00:14:38.830
Delicious...

00:14:39.900 --> 00:14:42.530
As I bite down, it dissolves into drops

00:14:42.530 --> 00:14:45.330
that overflow as they fizz in my mouth!

00:14:45.730 --> 00:14:49.670
It's like champagne jelly 
that's as sweet as honey!

00:14:52.070 --> 00:14:54.280
The Bubble Fruit is even more delicious

00:14:54.280 --> 00:14:56.880
when it's cooked,

00:14:56.880 --> 00:14:59.010
but it's still plenty good eaten as is.

00:15:00.920 --> 00:15:02.520
The esophagus...

00:15:03.220 --> 00:15:05.320
And now arriving in my stomach...

00:15:07.190 --> 00:15:08.390
Thank you.

00:15:09.760 --> 00:15:14.360
Thank you for becoming part of my body...

00:15:15.860 --> 00:15:18.430
...Bubble Fruit!

00:15:21.170 --> 00:15:24.770
Not only before you eat 
or while you're eating...

00:15:24.770 --> 00:15:29.980
You also respect and appreciate the 
ingredients after they're inside your body.

00:15:29.980 --> 00:15:33.850
And continuing to feel grateful, even 
after they become your flesh and blood,

00:15:33.850 --> 00:15:38.250
that's appreciating food to the umpteenth 
degree, which is called Food's End.

00:15:38.520 --> 00:15:41.720
With Food's End, ingredients that 
have been absorbed into the body

00:15:41.720 --> 00:15:45.990
are themselves grateful 
to the person who ate them

00:15:45.990 --> 00:15:49.630
and so they pump the body full of nutrients.

00:15:50.600 --> 00:15:52.900
Almost without limit...

00:15:52.900 --> 00:15:56.100
Come, there's plenty of temple treasure here.

00:15:59.870 --> 00:16:02.980
Engage in Food's End to your heart's content.

00:16:06.010 --> 00:16:07.650
The world

00:16:07.650 --> 00:16:09.820
looks like it's a completely different color.

00:16:10.920 --> 00:16:13.290
I didn't almost die.

00:16:13.620 --> 00:16:15.920
I <i>did</i> die.

00:16:15.920 --> 00:16:17.920
I'm so different from what 
I was until just before

00:16:17.920 --> 00:16:20.560
that I can't help thinking this way.

00:16:21.590 --> 00:16:24.100
It feels like I've been reborn.

00:16:24.730 --> 00:16:28.630
I need to go back to the temple right away.

00:16:29.400 --> 00:16:31.900
But I'm glad I was able to impart...

00:16:32.240 --> 00:16:33.940
...Honoring the Food!

00:16:40.750 --> 00:16:43.050
My senses aren't mistaken!

00:16:43.050 --> 00:16:46.450
Granny Chiyo! Why do you have that aura?!

00:16:53.460 --> 00:16:54.730
Chiyo-san...

00:16:55.190 --> 00:16:57.830
Please tell us what's going on here.

00:16:58.330 --> 00:17:00.860
I'm not going to tell you anything,

00:17:00.860 --> 00:17:04.230
Kapow. Where's Chin-chan?

00:17:07.070 --> 00:17:08.740
See our Golem?

00:17:08.740 --> 00:17:11.270
It's a hybrid made with 
all kinds of creatures.

00:17:11.270 --> 00:17:14.940
It's a kind of artificial life 
form, called a Scum Beast.

00:17:14.940 --> 00:17:18.880
There is only one organization 
that uses Golems.

00:17:20.620 --> 00:17:22.750
You're talking about Gourmet Corp.

00:17:33.030 --> 00:17:36.630
Already the Chowlin Temple 
branches have fallen.

00:17:36.630 --> 00:17:39.200
I cannot fathom your motive,

00:17:39.200 --> 00:17:42.670
but when Master Chin hears about this, 
I'm sure he will be much aggrieved.

00:17:43.610 --> 00:17:46.740
And Chiru-kun of Japanese Vanishing 
Cuisine will be sad as well.

00:17:47.280 --> 00:17:51.510
To think that you, Chiyo-san, 
respected all over the world,

00:17:51.510 --> 00:17:53.680
would join Gourmet Corp...

00:17:53.680 --> 00:17:56.080
The secret technique of Honoring the Food,

00:17:56.080 --> 00:18:01.060
Food's End, could become 
a threat to us, you see.

00:18:01.620 --> 00:18:04.290
So I'm going to cut it off at the roots!

00:18:04.990 --> 00:18:06.130
Wagon!

00:18:06.130 --> 00:18:08.400
In that case,

00:18:08.400 --> 00:18:11.100
I will have to deal with you.

00:18:12.270 --> 00:18:15.070
You have forgotten the fundamentals 
of Honoring the Food,

00:18:15.070 --> 00:18:18.240
being grateful towards 
food... towards life...

00:18:18.240 --> 00:18:19.970
...so I'm going to make you remember.

00:18:25.950 --> 00:18:28.180
I will not allow anyone

00:18:28.180 --> 00:18:30.880
to sully the sacred ground 
of Honoring the Food.

00:18:30.880 --> 00:18:34.760
It seems you've become somewhat 
confident in your abilities.

00:18:34.760 --> 00:18:37.920
Although you still make 
many wasted movements...

00:18:37.920 --> 00:18:39.390
Want to see something?

00:18:39.390 --> 00:18:41.900
With the way I handle a knife,

00:18:42.660 --> 00:18:45.130
they say one stroke is worth 
a hundred million yen!

00:18:45.130 --> 00:18:46.830
Be careful, Wagon!

00:18:46.830 --> 00:18:50.600
I, who have mastered Honoring 
the Food, make wasted movements?

00:18:51.440 --> 00:18:52.640
How amusing.

00:18:52.640 --> 00:18:55.940
Chiyo-san, I'd like to see your skills.

00:18:56.440 --> 00:18:58.750
I've already shown you.

00:19:18.730 --> 00:19:20.300
I don't believe it...

00:19:20.300 --> 00:19:22.570
I didn't notice a thing...

00:19:23.240 --> 00:19:26.300
If I wasn't aware of what she did,

00:19:26.300 --> 00:19:27.770
I think I'd still live on...

00:19:27.770 --> 00:19:31.740
Her knife was so delicate that 
I didn't sense any damage...

00:19:32.540 --> 00:19:33.140
Wagon!

00:19:33.240 --> 00:19:34.110
Wagon-san!

00:19:34.110 --> 00:19:36.210
You needn't be afraid.

00:19:36.210 --> 00:19:38.280
There's no pain...

00:19:38.280 --> 00:19:40.520
As long as you don't resist, that is...

00:19:41.420 --> 00:19:43.450
Get ready! Take her down, dead or alive!

00:19:56.800 --> 00:20:00.070
You see? I told you it 
would hurt if you moved!

00:20:00.070 --> 00:20:01.910
Slicing into one long thin strip is delicate!

00:20:01.910 --> 00:20:03.870
Move away, Shu!

00:20:03.870 --> 00:20:06.940
Honoring the Food, Hundredfold Grater!

00:20:06.940 --> 00:20:09.110
Cutting Board Shield!

00:20:11.880 --> 00:20:13.220
Lightning Cut!

00:20:18.760 --> 00:20:21.120
Take-chan? Take-chan, it is you, isn't it?!

00:20:25.260 --> 00:20:26.130
I knew it!

00:20:29.900 --> 00:20:32.000
I'm so glad you're alive!

00:20:32.840 --> 00:20:35.370
After we parted ways on such 
bad terms that last time...

00:20:35.370 --> 00:20:37.910
And I couldn't make contact with you...

00:20:38.610 --> 00:20:42.110
I was worried about you all this time!

00:20:43.050 --> 00:20:44.910
Me too, Komatsu.

00:20:47.250 --> 00:20:48.520
I'm glad you're alive...

00:20:49.550 --> 00:20:51.350
...and that we could see each other again.

00:20:56.430 --> 00:20:59.160
Now I can say goodbye.

00:21:22.280 --> 00:21:27.690
Under our feet, over our heads

00:21:29.460 --> 00:21:35.500
The world is spinning

00:21:38.400 --> 00:21:40.700
A dream flower

00:21:42.100 --> 00:21:44.370
Is blooming, blooming

00:21:45.670 --> 00:21:51.510
Tell me the rest, come on

00:21:51.850 --> 00:21:55.420
Lead me by the hand

00:21:55.420 --> 00:21:58.750
And take me with you

00:21:59.250 --> 00:22:06.090
Don't leave me here alone

00:22:06.460 --> 00:22:10.160
Red shoes

00:22:10.360 --> 00:22:13.600
I can't take off

00:22:14.000 --> 00:22:24.940
I'm the only one dancing

00:22:26.880 --> 00:22:29.820
Find Yun! Run, Run, Yun!

00:22:30.180 --> 00:22:34.290
Yun is hiding somewhere in the image 
you're about to see, so please find him!

00:22:34.220 --> 00:22:40.890
Hiding Level
11

00:22:34.990 --> 00:22:37.290
Today, Yun's Hiding Level is 11!

00:22:37.290 --> 00:22:39.060
The allotted time limit is 15 seconds!

00:22:39.060 --> 00:22:40.890
Let's have a heaping helping of start!

00:22:41.630 --> 00:22:44.030
So, where could Yun be?

00:22:44.030 --> 00:22:45.960
The Hiding Level is 11,

00:22:45.960 --> 00:22:48.330
but I'm sure your levels have risen, too.

00:22:48.330 --> 00:22:50.870
Maybe you'll be fine even without a hint?

00:22:52.040 --> 00:22:54.310
Yun is... right here!

00:22:57.880 --> 00:23:01.780
Did you find Yun among the 
heaping helping of hydrangeas?

00:23:01.780 --> 00:23:04.980
And now please pay a heaping helping 
of attention to the next segment!

00:23:06.980 --> 00:23:08.720
Chowlin Temple has turned into a war-zone!

00:23:08.950 --> 00:23:10.520
Hurry and show off the power of Food Immersion!

00:23:10.940 --> 00:23:13.190
Master Toriko heads to the battlefield!

00:23:13.690 --> 00:23:16.190
Unrivaled Strength! The One who Mastered Honoring the Food!

00:23:16.830 --> 00:23:18.400
Look forward to another heaping helping of fun!
